# Megawatt Valley — Cursor Primary Rules

## Status

**PRIMARY RULESET — 29 September 2026**

The project is no longer an active Unity project.

The full previous Unity state is preserved on branch **archive/unity-prototype-2026-09-29**.

The approved active implementation is the true-3D Three.js/Electron candidate on PR #11. Historical Phaser/Unity guidance does not override the latest product-owner decision.

## Read first

Before meaningful work, read:

- README.md
- Docs/CURSOR_PRIMARY_BUILD_SPEC.md
- Docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md
- Docs/VISUAL_DIRECTION.md
- Docs/TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md
